Caladea — Apache License, Version 2.0
====================================

Vendored payload: the 4 Caladea faces (Regular / Bold / Italic /
BoldItalic), TrueType flavour, unmodified. This Caladea is
metric-compatible with Cambria: a document set in Cambria keeps its line
and page breaks when Caladea takes its place.
Upstream: the Chrome OS font archive crosextrafonts-20130214 (Caladea
1.002, the build LibreOffice ships). A later Caladea, published under the
SIL Open Font License, has different metrics; it is not this payload.

